sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Host
    participant Q1 as CQ1 · transfer
    participant Q0 as CQ0 · compute
    H->>Q1: write input n+1
    Q1-->>Q1: record write_done
    Q0->>Q0: finish consuming input n
    Q0-->>Q1: consumer_done permits overwrite
    Q1-->>Q0: wait write_done
    Q0->>Q0: execute n+1
    Q0-->>H: completion/read dependency
